* golden-path.cos — common commands, subroutines, and event scripts.
* Deliberately error-free: TEST-CHECKLIST.md's golden-path pass expects
* zero diagnostics for this file.

**caos2pray
*#Name = "Golden path demo"

scrp 1 1 1 0
setv va00 31
setv va01 3.14
doif va00 eq 0
  outs "Hello, \"world\"!\n"
else
  sndl "c2sl"
endi

gsub Greet
attr 3
anim [0 1 2 3 255]
endm

subr Greet
  outs "Hi from a subroutine\n"
retn
